   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "TRANSITIONS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 13, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Transition style\n   2 Clip animation\n   3 Fade in and out\n   4 Transition family\n   5 Intro and outro effect\n   6 Match cut\n   7 suite: Classic and gentle\n   8 suite: Opening titles\n   9 suite: Time jump match cut\n  10 pair: When cutting gets fast, transitions become plain cuts\n  11 pair: When the feeling turns dreamlike, shots dissolve\n  12 pair: When the pace speeds up then stops, the scene fades out\n  13 pair: When the pace races then stops, an outro effect closes it\n  14 pair: When the end loops into the start, the cut matches movement\n  15 pair: When clips bounce in, the video turns playful\n  16 pair: When transitions get explosive, something new arrives every second or two\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 13, CC 97 to 97\n   1 pairs: The hyper edit"
   },
